<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: TENNIS-CZECH OPEN FIRST ROUND RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-CZECH OPEN FIRST ROUND RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>PRAGUE 1997-04-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>First round results in the</p>
<p>$365,000 Czech ATP tennis tournament on Monday (prefix number</p>
<p>denotes seeding):</p>
<p>Jan Kroslak (Slovakia) beat Michal Tabara (Czech Rep) 6-1 6-2</p>
<p>Richard Fromberg (Australia) beat 5-Javier Sanchez (Spain) 6-2</p>
<p>6-2</p>
<p>Stephane Simian (France) beat Francisco Roig (Spain) 4-6 6-2</p>
<p>6-4</p>
<p>Galo Blanco (Spain) beat Leander Paes (India) 6-7 (3-7) 6-3</p>
<p>6-4</p>
</text>
